      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَنِعَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَنَعَ</span></b> , (S, O, * K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَنَعٌ</span>, (S, O,)
<i>He abounded, and increased, in wealth.</i> (S, O,
K.) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْ قَنِعَ فَنِعَ</span> is a prov., (O, TA,) meaning
[<i>He who is contented</i>] <i>is free from want,</i> or <i>is
rich.</i> (TA.)

